SUMMARY:Black Widow: Web of Deceit | Saturday Night
LOCATION:217 Commonwealth Mansion
DESCRIPTION:Category: Holiday\nPrice: $295.00 per person\nAvailability: 2 s
 pots left\nStatus: You are Confirmed\nTime: 8 PM – 1 AM\nEvent URL: http
 s://members.thequinhouse.com/events/202989\n\nSlip into the camouflage of 
 costume for an evening under the ethereal shadows of lacy silk couture…\
 n\nYou're cordially invited to The ‘Quin’s Annual Halloween Soirée a
 n elegant and entangled ticketed affair. \n\nUnder the flicker of flame\,
  the ‘House will captivate with indulgent buffets\, enchanting performa
 nces\, and the deceivingly translucent jeweled veil - of the spider’s w
 eb.\n\nEnsnared? Fall victim.\n\nIn the shadowed corners of the ‘House\
 , become entangled in buffets of culinary bites\, live-action stations\, p
 assed delicacies\, and venomous cocktails. A dangerous game of hide-and-se
 ek\, spiral the Grand Staircase lured by live musical performances\, shado
 wed portraitists\, acrobats\, and other-worldly talents...\n\nPerilous vib
 es take center stage in \n\nBondo \n\nwith a Headline DJ Performance fro
 m \n\n10:00PM - Midnight\n\nIn the spirit of Halloween\, swarm the ‘Hou
 se.\n\nCreative black tie\, cocktail attire\, or a cleverly crafted costum
 e is essential.  \n\nTickets are exclusively available for purchase throu
 gh the Member App & Portal beginning September 16th at 10:00AM. Tickets fo
 r members and their guests are $295* each. To best accommodate members' v
 arying preferences\, we are delighted to extend a limited allocation of up
  to 1 guest ticket per member for Saturday evening's affair.\n\n*Beverage
 s are not included in the ticket price. Beverages will be available for pu
 rchase through our masterful team of mixologists. \n\n___________________
 ___________________________________\n\nPlease be aware of these important 
 notices:\n\nCANCELLATION POLICY\nKindly note that tickets are non-refundab
 le and nontransferable once assigned.\n\nENTRY\nAll Member and guest ticke
 ts purchased\, are linked to the Member’s profile through the App and Po
 rtal and are required for verification and entry on these evenings.\n\nGUE
 ST POLICY\nFollowing the regular Member Policy\, Members must arrive and r
 emain with their guest(s) at all times. Guests must be age 21+. We strongl
 y encourage review of the Members’ Policy to ensure that you and your gu
 est(s) are aware of Club rules.\n\nVALET SERVICES\nValet services will be 
 suspended on the evenings of October 23 & 24. Please plan ahead to secure 
 rideshare services or park at the nearest garage in Back Bay. Metered stre
 et parking is limited but also available.\n\nNO PHOTO POLICY\nPlease be aw
 are that we will offer a photo opportunity on these evenings\; however\, t
 he regular Photo Policy will otherwise be in effect and enforced. Those wh
 o do not comply with the Privacy Agreement will be asked to leave the Club
 house in keeping with the standards.\n\nThe ’Quin House has contracted p
 rofessional photographers and videographers to capture this event. Any pho
 tos or videos distributed through ’Quin public channels will be edited t
 o conceal the identities of participating Members and their guest(s). Phot
 os or videos that reveal Members will only be used in Member communication
  with the authorization of those captured.\n\nQuestions? Please contact us
  at halloween@thequin.com.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/202989
CATEGORIES:Holiday
